OL,3,GNEWSARewilding planned at Herstmonceux
OL,4,ACastle Estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to create a "biodiversity haven"
OL,7,Fby rewilding 240 acres of land at
OL,8,FHerstmonceux Castle Estate have been
OL,9,Fannounced.
OL,11,FBader College, which sits on the
OL,12,Festate, has linked up with nature
OL,13,Frestoration organisation Nattergal to
OL,14,Frevive land previously used for farming
OL,15,Fby restoring pasture, grassland, and
OL,16,Fscrub habitats.
OL,18,FThe rewilding aims to transform
OL,19,Fhundreds of acres of wildlife habitat
OL,20,Fand offer research opportunities to
OL,21,FQueen's University in Canada which owns
OL,22,FBader College.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
